      "id": "sol.amc-8-1999-p4.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Looking at the graph, we have that Alberto has biked \\(60\\) miles and Bjorn \\(45\\) miles after \\(4\\) hours.\n\nThe difference between the two distances is \\( 60 - 45 = 15 \\) miles.\n\nThus, A is the correct answer.",
